    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d569-a2">

                <pb facs="0677" n="581" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg581"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bingham to Mr.
                            Merry.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >British Consulate</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bluefields</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-05-04"><hi rendition="#italic">May 4,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge receipt of
                    your communication, dated the 3d instant, in which you request me, on behalf of
                    the United States Government, to receive on trust, in accordance with the terms
                    of an agreement made between yourself and the minister of foreign affairs of
                    Nicaragua, copy of which you inclosed me, the amount of $19,673.33, Nicaraguan
                    currency, claimed from certain American establishments in this city as due to
                    the customs authorities of Bluefields.</p>
                <p>I shall have much pleasure in accepting the trust with which you honor me.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">H. F. Bingham</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Her Britannic Majesty’s
                    Consul.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
